{
  "set_from": "fn-157 (2026-09-26): the beech's readings as the live run and the recorded pages hold them, with the document kinds data/cases/kind.json admits; each case is what a person admits the aggregate should decide. The agreement and outlier bounds (agree.rs) must answer every case.",
  "cases": [
